&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-installation&#34;&gt;1. Installation
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The ODP Python Package can be installed from &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://pypi.org/project/openbb/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;PyPI package&lt;/a&gt; by running &lt;code&gt;pip install openbb&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;or by cloning the repository directly with &lt;code&gt;git clone https://github.com/OpenBB-finance/OpenBB.git&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please find more about the installation process, in the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.openbb.co/python/installation&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;OpenBB Documentation&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;odp-cli-installation&#34;&gt;ODP CLI installation
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The ODP CLI is a command-line interface that allows you to access the ODP directly from your command line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It can be installed by running &lt;code&gt;pip install openbb-cli&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;or by cloning the repository directly with  &lt;code&gt;git clone https://github.com/OpenBB-finance/OpenBB.git&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please find more about the installation process in the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.openbb.co/cli/installation&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;OpenBB Documentation&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;2-contributing&#34;&gt;2. Contributing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;There are three main ways of contributing to this project. (Hopefully you have starred the project by now ⭐️)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;become-a-contributor&#34;&gt;Become a Contributor
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More information on our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.openbb.co/python/developer&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Developer Documentation&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;create-a-github-ticket&#34;&gt;Create a GitHub ticket
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Before creating a ticket make sure the one you are creating doesn&amp;rsquo;t exist already &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/OpenBB-finance/OpenBB/issues&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;among the existing issues&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/OpenBB-finance/OpenBB/issues/new?assignees=&amp;amp;labels=bug&amp;amp;template=bug_report.md&amp;amp;title=%5BBug%5D&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Report bug&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/OpenBB-finance/OpenBB/issues/new?assignees=&amp;amp;labels=enhancement&amp;amp;template=enhancement.md&amp;amp;title=%5BIMPROVE%5D&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Suggest improvement&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/OpenBB-finance/OpenBB/issues/new?assignees=&amp;amp;labels=new&amp;#43;feature&amp;amp;template=feature_request.md&amp;amp;title=%5BFR%5D&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Request a feature&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;provide-feedback&#34;&gt;Provide feedback
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are most active on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://openbb.co/discord&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;our Discord&lt;/a&gt;, but feel free to reach out to us in any of &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://openbb.co/links&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;our social media&lt;/a&gt; for feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
